 properties of FSS - 1 0 0 0 : Scalability To extend FSS - 1 0 0 0 to include a new class , all it takes are 1 0 images with pixelwise binary segmen - Figure 3 .This is significantly easier than other datasets such as PASCAL VOC and COCO .Instance FSS - 1 0 0 0 dataset supports instance - level segmentation with instance segmentation labels in 7 5 8 out of the 1, 0 0 0 classes in the dataset , which are significantly more classes than PASCAL VOC and MS COCO .One
